{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-2","kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得算法：求两个整数的最大公约数","englishTitle":"Given two numbers not prime to one another, to find their greatest common measure.","book":7,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","contentId":"euclid-7-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6bfcef989890142a11de83c1122868625eac59a5205ad99e408932a646ddcdc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-2.statement","euclid-7-2.construction.1","euclid-7-2.proof.1","euclid-7-2.proof.2","euclid-7-2.proof.3","euclid-7-2.proof.4","euclid-7-2.proof.5","euclid-7-2.proof.6","euclid-7-2.proof.7","euclid-7-2.proof.8","euclid-7-2.proof.9","euclid-7-2.proof.10","euclid-7-2.proof.11","euclid-7-2.proof.12","euclid-7-2.proof.13","euclid-7-2.proof.14","euclid-7-2.proof.15","euclid-7-2.construction.2","euclid-7-2.proof.16","euclid-7-2.proof.17","euclid-7-2.proof.18","euclid-7-2.proof.19","euclid-7-2.proof.20","euclid-7-2.proof.21","euclid-7-2.conclusion","euclid-7-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa70ecf6e4c3212317d7ef35700b4e51230e970aa8e946879d9082182670ab50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given two numbers not prime to one another, to find their greatest common measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定两个不互素的正整数，求它们的最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"500f5feaf7dc777c864b27f81715190f06122331dec763b87bc011b4bca3c313","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be the two given numbers not prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD是两个给定的数字 不是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94950edc7dc0a93400161d61f132fb8403c0cf9129d6eeba4542c9a0aac6c737","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to find the greatest common measure of AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它必须找到AB,CD中最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fffdfb98b130af78085394f5f337241e35e46c9938bce1fb043a56d41d394f51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If now CD measures AB—and it also measures itself—CD is a common measure of CD, AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果现在CD 整除 AB——它本身整除——CD是CD AB中的整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bdd40df9623bbe4b4d69af0908cb534725ca391cd5384619f637a6d5edde810","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is manifest that it is also the greatest; for no greater number than CD will measure CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"显然,它也是最大的;因为数量不超过CD,整除将达到CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e09e9875918d3af10954e40dadd797b2b9bd2a985e56ea84d6f5da16cea886b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if CD does not measure AB, then, the less of the numbers AB, CD being continually subtracted from the greater, some number will be left which will measure the one before it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果CD没有整除 AB,那么,AB,CD这个数目中较小数量的数量会不断从较大数量中减去,那么,将留下一些数量,而它面前的数量将达到整除个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"875b9be2f7afff53cd7bbe4369bd13f3339a248776018a2685e18242054fc971","citations":["euclid-7-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For an unit will not be left; otherwise AB, CD will be prime to one another [[VII. 1](/principles/euclid-7-1)], which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"单位不会留下;否则AB、CD将留下互素,这与假设相反。 [[VII. 1](/principles/euclid-7-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47603c96288316b7e8ba4da6d2f86e7e1df5b1125cd860cb91db19fc6d197d0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore some number will be left which will measure the one before it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,将留下一些数字,这些数字将留给它面前的整除个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f0116569296325cc545278c7a7e8a586f330aff923be16a3df209fb96bf091e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let CD, measuring BE, leave EA less than itself, let EA, measuring DF, leave FC less than itself, and let CF measure AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在让CD,BE,离开EA比自己少EA,DF,FC让CF 整除 AE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2aec91653a277689395ef4fc7ae0c7a26eacbef6c5e2c325ff03de30fd95b13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, CF measures AE, and AE measures DF, therefore CF will also measure DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,CF 整除 AE和AE 整除 DF,因此CF也将整除 DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d53c8bacb33060cf6e5b08d9a62618534170880717fc8b4f7451ecc54b91cc1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures itself; therefore it will also measure the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它本身也是整除;因此它也将是整除整个CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e6e463fdb9b14bb565e9e1b3e5b199202f2a054d8332b0d8000d160064aa6a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD measures BE; therefore CF also measures BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是CD 整除 BE,因此CF 也是整除 BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59e98a7d7b2d400bba3281a08f732e6d53f2bd565c6c87a3678d19ad684ab03e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures EA; therefore it will also measure the whole BA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 EA,因此它也将整除 整个BA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3a34aafad90c98d2fc04968723bbe1104e8947fe9768f0f8e89b27f9bbda2b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures CD; therefore CF measures AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 CD;因此,CF 整除 AB,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb246edfaa0ceb3dd456e06cb5f5b4fe4cf15d37054e82d868a4839a5914fd76","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CF is a common measure of AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CF是AB,CD中常见的整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d601a2226cb30a3cfb5f77868366f58ff9f45ffd66f31803b59b1f868041374","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the greatest."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是最伟大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"53f20277209f9ede8a454bdef2306dd86d767704a66ffbf32c67da545fcfecf4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if CF is not the greatest common measure of AB, CD, some number which is greater than CF will measure the numbers AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CF不是AB中最大公约数,CD,则超过CF的整除将达到AB,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":17,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9e377725bbfd59e7ebc06798fb3c4e3b8d07a65de91d76b9bc9629e9f678eb1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let such a number measure them, and let it be G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除,G"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e778485c1eabdfdb8f41a7c85922e2d2cb8ba9d459c15acaad71434fc68f875","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since G measures CD, while CD measures BE, G also measures BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,G 整除 CD,而CD 整除 BE,G还有整除 BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2f857f6d38d08ffcf4d91d7e441c23250997fae786c41c81c161ad6ba21210f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures the whole BA; therefore it will also measure the remainder AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除整个BA;因此它也将整除其余AE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a7ea030717978f375cfb3d2a6929b75165e3f6102c298d4cf54288e3a86dc3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE measures DF; therefore G will also measure DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE 整除 DF, 因此G 也将会整除 DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a82bc03788a5f09092e1e017c77ab763cbd4300f954e429230721afa1f1f73e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures the whole DC; therefore it will also measure the remainder CF, that is, the greater will measure the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除整个DC, 因此它也将整除 其余CF, 即,数量越大,数量就越小, 数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb40cee32abad85536adb68b45be0035e27d619d0a28fc6ac86a8b0155fe0fd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number which is greater than CF will measure the numbers AB, CD; therefore CF is the greatest common measure of AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果数字不超过CF,整除将达到AB,CD;因此,CF是AB,CD中最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2de4035a9b2d2daf6c2d0a18974bad3b7e9dba87d1d1d0aaa78768b24777853a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if a number measure two numbers, it will also measure their greatest common measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,从这一点来看,很明显,如果数字是整除,两个数字,那么,整除个数字也是它们最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":24,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-2.source","contentId":"euclid-7-2","revisionId":"euclid-7-2@raw-f6bfcef989890142","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aff08bb8921273c914fd8d461f8c69fe4535f96ccd79854d2c918a01c5de61cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-2:euclid-7-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-2.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-3:euclid-7-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-3.construction.2","euclid-7-3.proof.5","euclid-7-3.proof.10","euclid-7-3.construction.4","euclid-7-3.proof.16","euclid-7-3.proof.18"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"VII. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-4:euclid-7-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-4.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VII. 2"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-2:euclid-7-1:explicit","id":"euclid-7-1","book":7,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"互素判定与辗转相减法","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-3:euclid-7-2:explicit","id":"euclid-7-3","book":7,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"求三个整数的最大公约数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-4:euclid-7-2:explicit","id":"euclid-7-4","book":7,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
